</code></pre> <p>reads <code>UNIMINED_AUTH_ACCESS_TOKEN</code> (required) plus optional <code>UNIMINED_AUTH_USERNAME</code>/<code>_UUID</code>/<code>_XUID</code>/<code>_USER_TYPE</code> at execution — provision them from the runner's secret store. Alternatively run <code>:loginMicrosoft</code> locally and ship the resulting <code>credentials.json</code> (which still resolves through the same <code>unimined.auth.*</code> props).</p>

